sequenceDiagram
  participant S as AWS Service (S3 / EBS)
  participant K as AWS KMS (KMS key in HSM)
  participant St as Storage
  Note over S,St: ENCRYPT
  S->>K: GenerateDataKey(KMS key)
  K-->>S: Plaintext data key + Encrypted data key
  S->>S: Encrypt data with plaintext key, then delete plaintext key
  S->>St: Store encrypted data + encrypted data key
  Note over S,St: DECRYPT
  S->>St: Read encrypted data + encrypted data key
  S->>K: Decrypt(encrypted data key)
  K-->>S: Plaintext data key (if key policy allows)
  S->>S: Decrypt data
